+### User transfer (between organizations)
+
+- Only an org admin of the organization in the path may transfer a user out of it. Another organization's path → 404; a non-admin member of the organization → 403.
+- The user must currently belong to the organization in the path, otherwise 404. The destination must be an existing organization different from the current one, otherwise 400.
+- The transfer leaves the source organization's projects: the user's memberships there are removed, and tasks assigned to them there are unassigned. Nothing else changes.
+- The org admin flag does not move with the user; the user is a plain member in the new organization.
+- The transfer is all-or-nothing: a rejected request changes nothing.
+
